  ID: elderfungus
  Logs:
  - 'the elder fungus saw potential in me and gifted me the spectral flame. it can
    be used for traversal and violence. I should speak to some of the students in
    the shell temple if i want to learn more. '
  - 'my quest is to journey to the city of aorta. i must find the flower girl for
    guidance. first though, it is important i go to the slime garden for more teachings.  '
